    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d206">

                <pb facs="0378" n="292" xml:id="pg292"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Marshal Stalin to President Roosevelt
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">Translation<anchor n="1" xml:id="d206-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Personal and Secret from Premier J. V. Stalin to President
                    Franklin Roosevelt.</p>
                <p>Thank you for your reply<anchor n="2" xml:id="d206-f2"/> on the French question.
                    Together with General De-Gaulle we came to
                    a decision that the conclusion of the Franco-Soviet Pact of mutual assistance
                    will be beneficial to the cause of the French-Soviet relations as well as for
                    the European security in general. Today the Franco-Soviet Pact was
                        signed.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d206-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>As to the post-war border of France, the consideration of this question, as I
                    have already written to you,<anchor n="4" xml:id="d206-f4"/> has been
                    postponed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1944-12-10"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >December 10, 1944</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
